1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,281
Welcome back!

2
00:00:01,281 --> 00:00:06,204
In this lesson, we'll set up a product
with two ways to pay, then use it to build,

3
00:00:06,204 --> 00:00:09,927
send and settle a professional
invoice, in just a few minutes.

4
00:00:10,779 --> 00:00:12,976
Start in Payments, under Products.

5
00:00:12,976 --> 00:00:17,952
A product is anything you sell, and each
product can have one or more prices.

6
00:00:17,952 --> 00:00:21,376
Set them up once, and you
can reuse them on invoices,

7
00:00:21,376 --> 00:00:26,029
payment links and order forms, with
the right name and price every time.

8
00:00:26,879 --> 00:00:28,152
Click Create product.

9
00:00:28,152 --> 00:00:32,276
Give it a clear name, the way you'd
like it to appear on an invoice.

10
00:00:32,276 --> 00:00:37,309
I'll add composite bonding, with a short
description your patients will understand.

11
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:39,513
Now add a price.

12
00:00:39,513 --> 00:00:43,825
This first one is a one-time
price: £250 per tooth.

13
00:00:45,060 --> 00:00:48,719
Then add a second price, so
patients can spread the cost.

14
00:00:48,719 --> 00:00:53,213
Choose Recurring, set £70, billed
monthly, and limit it to 4 payments.

15
00:00:53,213 --> 00:00:58,349
Leave the number of payments blank for
something that runs until it’s cancelled,

16
00:00:58,349 --> 00:00:59,826
like a membership plan.

17
00:01:00,685 --> 00:01:02,983
Both prices are listed under Pricing.

18
00:01:02,983 --> 00:01:07,019
Click Save product, and it joins
your product list, ready to use.

19
00:01:07,868 --> 00:01:09,445
Now let's bill a patient.

20
00:01:09,445 --> 00:01:12,724
Go to Invoices and Estimates,
and click New invoice.

21
00:01:12,724 --> 00:01:17,770
On the left is the invoice itself, with
your business details already filled in.

22
00:01:17,770 --> 00:01:20,167
On the right are its payment settings.

23
00:01:21,017 --> 00:01:24,075
Click Add customer, and
search for the contact.

24
00:01:24,075 --> 00:01:24,856
Emma Clarke.

25
00:01:24,856 --> 00:01:27,980
Then click Add item, and
pick composite bonding.

26
00:01:27,980 --> 00:01:32,079
Emma is having two teeth done,
so I'll set the quantity to two.

27
00:01:32,079 --> 00:01:34,292
I'll also add her teeth whitening.

28
00:01:35,249 --> 00:01:35,955
Next, tax.

29
00:01:35,955 --> 00:01:40,829
Tick the Tax box on each line that
needs it, and VAT at 20% is added.

30
00:01:40,829 --> 00:01:46,691
Cosmetic treatments like whitening are
often taxable, while most dental care isn’t.

31
00:01:46,691 --> 00:01:50,011
If you’re not sure, check
with your accountant.

32
00:01:50,862 --> 00:01:51,969
Choose a due date.

33
00:01:51,969 --> 00:01:53,568
I'll give Emma seven days.

34
00:01:53,568 --> 00:01:57,504
On the right, card payments are
on, because Stripe is connected.

35
00:01:57,504 --> 00:02:02,485
You can also allow partial payments, and
Kyntlo will send polite reminders before

36
00:02:02,485 --> 00:02:03,899
and after the due date.

37
00:02:04,754 --> 00:02:07,221
When it looks right, click Send invoice.

38
00:02:07,221 --> 00:02:09,504
Send it by email and by text message.

39
00:02:09,504 --> 00:02:13,638
Patients are far more likely to
pay straight away from their phone.

40
00:02:13,638 --> 00:02:14,625
Then click Send.

41
00:02:15,562 --> 00:02:17,879
The invoice is now marked as sent.

42
00:02:17,879 --> 00:02:20,877
When Emma pays online,
it updates by itself.

43
00:02:20,877 --> 00:02:26,056
If she pays at reception instead, click
Record payment, choose how she paid,

44
00:02:26,056 --> 00:02:26,669
and save.

45
00:02:26,669 --> 00:02:28,714
The invoice is marked as paid.

46
00:02:29,564 --> 00:02:30,610
Here's a pro tip.

47
00:02:30,610 --> 00:02:34,243
For bigger treatments, send an
estimate before the invoice.

48
00:02:34,243 --> 00:02:36,706
It's in the same place, under Estimates.

49
00:02:36,706 --> 00:02:41,632
The patient can accept it online, and you
have their agreement in writing before

50
00:02:41,632 --> 00:02:42,618
any work begins.

51
00:02:43,469 --> 00:02:45,370
You've sent your first invoice!

52
00:02:45,370 --> 00:02:50,154
In the next lesson, we'll look at even
faster ways to get paid: payment links,

53
00:02:50,154 --> 00:02:51,749
Text2Pay, and order forms.

54
00:02:51,749 --> 00:02:52,607
See you there.
